# Flam MEF File format
OK  Flam  extensionName     STRING  EXTNAME   F  NULL    INDEX  NULL     "Name assigned to a FITS extension."  
OK  Flam  extensionVersion  INT     EXTVER    F  NULL    INDEX  NULL     "Number assigned to a FITS extension."  
OK  Flam  frameId           STRING  FRAMEID   F  NULL    NONE   NULL     "Frame ID"  
OK  Flam  instrument        STRING  INSTRUME  F  NULL    NONE   NULL     "Instrument used to acquire data."  
OK  Flam  axisLabel         STRING  AXISLAB   F  NULL    INDEX  NULL     "Axis label"  
OK  Flam  telescope         STRING  TELESCOP  F  Gemini  NONE   NULL     "Telescope where data taken"  
OK  Flam  frameName         STRING  FRMNAME   F  NULL    INDEX  NULL     "Name assigned to a frame of data."  
OK  Flam  dataType          STRING  DATATYP   F  NULL    NONE   NULL     "Type of data frame"  

